      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Standard or your own sizing",
          "title": "Change a measurement, get a new pipe",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Every pipe family has the same basic design, with room to vary. A little wider for more ground tone, a little narrower for more harmonics, a higher cut-up and a different length for higher wind pressure.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In PipeCreator we change the inside width and depth, panel thickness and length of our standard models in minutes. The G-code goes straight to the CNC. So a pipe to your own measurements takes about as long as a standard one.",
              "spans": []
            }
          ],
          "image": {},
          "video": {
            "link_type": "Media"
          },
          "image_brief": "Looping clip (mp4, 10–15 s): a pipe model in PipeCreator at the office, a measurement being changed and the 3D pipe updating. Screen recording or filmed monitor, 4:3.",
          "media_side": "Image left",
          "aspect": "Landscape 4:3",
          "cta_label": null,
          "cta_link": {
            "link_type": "Any"
          },
          "tone": "Tinted"
        },
        "id": "site_text_media$b7c8b2b9-5207-40f9-9a0e-3336080afca8",
        "slice_type": "site_text_media",
        "slice_label": null
      },
      {
        "variation": "default",
        "version": "initial",
        "items": [],
        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Wood",
          "title": "Ayous bodies, beech feet and mouths",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A CNC does not see the difference between fine grain and a knot, so we chose the wood for the machine and for the sound. The body is Ayous (Triplochiton scleroxylon): very stable, pale yellow and virtually free of knots. Feet and mouths are made of hand-selected beech.",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "start": 133,
                  "end": 138,
                  "type": "strong"
                },
                {
                  "start": 140,
                  "end": 164,
                  "type": "em"
                },
